73631/uploads/origins/ca96561e-ae79-4118-9bdf-a3eea1b55e80?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3a04bb3c0d043abd3f2096ac16fbbe71 3x"}, "body": "V I want you to draw...\n\"Yotsuba Amou.\"\nThree views of the model (the mama of this V)\nhttps://twitter.com/poo_mame/status/1414207528913698819?t=IvRexy7g0saOgNWlzUM98Q&s=19\nCostume\nLoose, fluffy, girly clothes (see URL for image)\nThe color scheme of the clothes is the same as in the document, with the following changes\nThe green part was changed to a plaid pattern.\nThe skirt part is a tiered frill skirt.\nHairstyle\nTwin-tail hairstyle\nRabbit style (knot position) and horsetail (hair length)\nHair clip should be pompon? Please make it a pompom (round and fluffy)\nPlease use a pompom.\n\nhttps://x.com/sirotume4634/status/1747499124218556555?s=20", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@pretty__1111/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1757863, "client_id": 3075510, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ca88b8bf/uploads/origins/1d2d4338-75fb-4689-bded-e846ce30ec66?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=13901a114b889e18a4b3e4fbb3004f92", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ca88b8bf/uploads/origins/1d2d4338-75fb-4689-bded-e846ce30ec66?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=13901a114b889e18a4b3e4fbb3004f92, https://si.imgix.net/ca88b8bf/uploads/origins/1d2d4338-75fb-4689-bded-e846ce30ec66?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dd3d53767b89e5dc281bf1a6797f5659 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ca88b8bf/uploads/origins/1d2d4338-75fb-4689-bded-e846ce30ec66?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6333a6ef50a9d89c6f807e7719fa600a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardco